   "html": "<section class=\"page-hero page-hero--plain page-hero--compact\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Book a room</li></ol>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Book direct</p>\n        <h1 id=\"page-title\">Book your stay</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Live availability and prices straight from our reservations diary. Choose your dates, pick a room and book securely.</p>\n        <p class=\"booking-summary\" data-booking-summary hidden></p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
